meta {
  name: Journal
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  `JournalController` — the parent-private journal about a child. Requires the caller to have access
  to the child (owner or collaborator). No educator endpoint by design.

  Tags: `Incident | Communication | Medical | Progress | Other` (case-insensitive on input).
  `occurredOn` is `yyyy-MM-dd` and must not be after today (UTC). `contentMarkdown` is sanitized and
  limited to 4000 characters. Linked ids must resolve to records of the same child.
}
